,17:I:X:pit37@v3_fast,12:checks-green,379:run real11/v3/asks/core.tally real11/v3/facts/2026.tally real11/v3/law/pl/benefits.tally real11/v3/law/pl/business.tally real11/v3/law/pl/common.tally real11/v3/law/pl/employment.tally real11/v3/law/pl/wrappers.tally real11/v3/loans.tally real11/v3/pays.tally real11/v3/people.tally real11/v3/places.tally real11/v3/reality.tally real11/v3/records/mbank/2026-09.tally --ask pit37,50076:25:real11/v3/asks/core.tally,1238:part asks_core
