,9:I:M:RC-08,12:checks-green,34:run integration/models/RC-08.tally,30162:30:integration/models/RC-08.tally,30121:model rc08
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2022-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "Poland, ulga dla pracowników (the middle-class relief) of 2022: the payroll relief of art. 32 ust. 2a and the annual relief of art. 26 ust. 4a-4c PIT, as enacted by Dz.U. 2021 poz. 2105, and their removal by Dz.U. 2022 poz. 1265."
  note "The monthly relief is keyed by month, so its law date is the month's first day: art. 18 ust. 3 and art. 23 ust. 4 of poz. 1265 stop it for income from 1 July 2022. The annual relief is keyed by tax year: art. 18 ust. 2 disapplies it for all 2022 income, a change known only from 15 June 2022."
  note "The Ministry's guides are dated 6 April 2022, so the asks that reproduce their annual answers and their simulations run as known on that day. The monthly examples run on current knowledge, in a month the relief still covers. The examples' facts are stipulations, known from start, 1 January 2022, the first day of their year."
  note "No provision states how the relief is rounded; the two firms differ, so it is an axis. The simulations' advances and taxes are modelled as the law states them, art. 32 ust. 1, 2a and 3 and art. 27 ust. 1, with the bases and the amounts rounded to full złoty by Ordynacja podatkowa art. 63 § 1; the payroll figures the sources don't give (the costs, the social insurance contributions, whether a PIT-2 statement was filed) are holes, and so are the 2021 law and the joint method of art. 6 ust. 2, which the case doesn't transcribe."

source du2011_1707 "Ustawa z dnia 22 grudnia 2011 r. o zmianie niektórych ustaw związanych z realizacją ustawy budżetowej (Dz.U. 2011 Nr 291 poz. 1707), art. 4 pkt 1: Ordynacja podatkowa art. 63 § 1 otrzymuje brzmienie" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2011/1707/text.pdf"

source du2019_1835 "Ustawa z dnia 30 sierpnia 2019 r. o zmianie ustawy o podatku dochodowym od osób fizycznych oraz ustawy o zmianie ustawy o podatku dochodowym od osób fizycznych oraz niektórych innych ustaw (Dz.U. 2019 poz. 1835)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2019/1835/text.html"

source du2021_2105 "Ustawa z dnia 29 października 2021 r. o zmianie ustawy o podatku dochodowym od osób fizycznych, ustawy o podatku dochodowym od osób prawnych oraz niektórych innych ustaw (Dz.U. 2021 poz. 2105)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2021/2105/text.html"

source du2022_1265 "Ustawa z dnia 9 czerwca 2022 r. o zmianie ustawy o podatku dochodowym od osób fizycznych oraz niektórych innych ustaw (Dz.U. 2022 poz. 1265)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2022/1265/text.html"

source ifirma "IFIRMA S.A., Ulga dla klasy średniej w Polskim Ładzie (Małgorzata Jagusiak), 2021-11-23" at "https://www.ifirma.pl/blog/podatki/polski-lad/ulga-dla-klasy-sredniej-w-polskim-ladzie/"

source lifted_1_0_1 "Figures tally 1.0.1 allowed inline in rules"

source mf_employer "Ministerstwo Finansów / KAS, Przewodnik dla pracodawcy: Ulga dla klasy średniej, wersja z 06.04.2022 r. (Wayback capture of 2022-08-05)" at "https://web.archive.org/web/20220805042959id_/https://www.podatki.gov.pl/media/8050/polski_lad_poradnik_dla_pracodawcy_06_04.pdf"

source mf_taxpayer "Ministerstwo Finansów / KAS, Przewodnik dla podatnika: Ulga dla klasy średniej, stan na 06.04.2022 r. (Wayback capture of 2022-08-05)" at "https://web.archive.org/web/20220805043008id_/https://www.podatki.gov.pl/media/8049/polski_lad_poradnik_dla_podatnika_06_04.pdf"

source modeller "The model's own assumptions, each stated with its reason"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

axis mc_round
  gr_down "the relief cut to the grosz below, as wFirma prints it"
  gr_exact "no rounding is stated: the relief is kept exact"
  gr_half_up "the relief rounded to the nearest grosz, a half grosz up, as ifirma prints it"

index abr = [below, f1, f2, above]

index basis = [individual, joint]

index jcase = [q2, q3, q4, q5, q6, q7, s2a, s2b, s3]

index mcase = [m1, m2, m3, m4, q1, s1a, s1b]

index mo = month 2022-01..2022-12

index payment = [m1_pay, m2_pay, m3_pay1, m3_pay2, m4_pay1, m4_pay2, q1_salary, q1_sick, s1a_pay, s1b_pay]

index pkind = [employment, social_benefit]

index spouse = [sp1, sp2]

index yr = year 2022..2022

input a_basis_2: int
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input adv_free_12: int
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input adv_rate: num

input ann_c1: money PLN

input ann_c2: money PLN

input ann_r1: num

input ann_r2: num

input biz_net[j in jcase, s in spouse]: money PLN question "What was the spouse's revenue from business taxed on the scale, less the costs of the business other than social insurance contributions, in the year?"

input emp_income[j in jcase, s in spouse]: money PLN question "What was the spouse's income from employment in the year: the revenue less the costs of earning it and the social insurance contributions deducted from income?"

input emp_rev[j in jcase, s in spouse]: money PLN question "What was the spouse's revenue from employment taxed under art. 27 in the year?"

input formula_div: num

input free_amount: money PLN

input granted[c in mcase]: money PLN question "What relief did the payer already apply at an earlier payment in the month?"

input mon_c1: money PLN

input mon_c2: money PLN

input mon_r1: num

input mon_r2: num

input month_income[c in mcase]: money PLN question "What is the month's income from the employment under art. 32 ust. 2: the revenue less the costs of earning it and the social insurance contributions?"

input pay_amount[p in payment]: money PLN question "How much was paid?"

input pay_case[p in payment]: key mcase

input pay_kind[p in payment]: key pkind question "Is the payment revenue from employment, or a cash benefit from social insurance?"

input pit2_filed[c in mcase]: bool question "Did the employee file the statement of art. 32 ust. 3 (PIT-2) with the payer before the year's first payment?"

input waiver[c in mcase]: bool question "Did the employee ask in writing that the payer not reduce the income by the relief (art. 32 ust. 2b)?"

band ann_band(a: num PLN): key abr
  note "art. 26 ust. 4a-4b: which formula applies to A, the year's revenue"

band mon_band(a: money PLN): key abr
  note "art. 32 ust. 2a: which formula applies to A, the month's revenue"

band pit_scale(x: num PLN): num PLN
  note "art. 27 ust. 1: the tax on the base. Below 30 000 zł the first row is negative; the transcribed text doesn't say what the tax is then, and no example reaches it"

def a_basis[j in jcase, s in spouse, b in basis]: num PLN at reader
  note "the A the relief is figured on: the spouse's own (art. 26 ust. 4a), or half the spouses' combined A when they file jointly (ust. 4c)"
  rule individual v dz2021_2105 = a_rev[j, s] when b == individual
  rule joint v dz2021_2105 = sum(a_rev[j, t] for t in spouse) / a_basis_2 when b == joint

def a_rev[j in jcase, s in spouse]: money PLN at reader
  note "art. 26 ust. 4a: A is the year's employment revenue taxed under art. 27 plus the business revenue less its costs other than social insurance contributions"
  rule base v dz2021_2105 = emp_rev[j, s] + biz_net[j, s]

def addback[c in mcase, m in mo]: num PLN at start_of(m)
  note "MF employer guide p. 4, Przykład II: when the month's total payments leave the band, the relief applied at an earlier payment is added to the base of the advance at the later payment"
  rule base v mf_employer_2022 = max(0, granted[c] - mon_relief[c, m])

def adv[c in mcase, m in mo]: money PLN at start_of(m)
  note "the month's advance, a kwota podatku, rounded to full złoty: Ordynacja podatkowa art. 63 § 1"
  rule base v dz2011_1707 = round(adv_raw[c, m], 1, half-up)

def adv_2021[c in mcase, m in mo]: money PLN at start_of(m)
  note "the MF simulation's '2021 rules' column: the advance on the same salary under the law of 2021"
  rule base = ?"The 2021 law behind the MF simulation's '2021 rules' columns is not among the case's sources."

def adv_base[c in mcase, m in mo]: money PLN at start_of(m)
  note "the base of the advance, a podstawa opodatkowania, rounded to full złoty: Ordynacja podatkowa art. 63 § 1, końcówki kwot wynoszące mniej niż 50 groszy pomija się, a końcówki kwot wynoszące 50 i więcej groszy podwyższa się do pełnych złotych"
  rule base v dz2011_1707 = round(adv_income[c, m], 1, half-up)

def adv_free[c in mcase, m in mo]: num PLN at start_of(m)
  note "art. 32 ust. 3: the advance is reduced by 1/12 of the kwota zmniejszająca podatek of the scale's first bracket when the employee filed the statement before the year's first payment"
  rule base = 0
  rule pit2 beats base v dz2021_2105 = free_amount / adv_free_12 when pit2_filed[c]

def adv_income[c in mcase, m in mo]: num PLN at start_of(m)
  note "art. 32 ust. 2a: the month's income less the relief. The relief reduces the income before the base is rounded, as art. 32 ust. 2a reduces the dochód"
  rule base v dz2021_2105 = month_income[c] - mon_relief[c, m]

def adv_raw[c in mcase, m in mo]: num PLN at start_of(m)
  note "art. 32 ust. 1 pkt 1 and ust. 3: the rate times the rounded base, less the monthly part of the kwota zmniejszająca podatek"
  note "art. 32 ust. 1 pkt 2 (32% on the part of the year's income from the payer above the first bracket) is not modelled"
  rule base v dz2021_2105 = adv_base[c, m] * adv_rate - adv_free[c, m]

def ann_applies[y in yr, j in jcase, s in spouse, b in basis]: bool at start_of(y)
  note "art. 26 ust. 4b: the relief applies when A is at least the lower limit and not above the upper one; ust. 4c applies ust. 4b to the joint A"
  rule base v dz2021_2105 = ann_band(a_basis[j, s, b]) in [f1, f2]
  rule repealed beats base v dz2022_1265_y = false

def ann_relief[y in yr, j in jcase, s in spouse, b in basis]: num PLN at start_of(y)
  note "art. 26 ust. 4a: the annual relief, deducted from income under ust. 1 pkt 2aa"
  rule f1 v dz2021_2105 = (a_basis[j, s, b] * ann_r1 - ann_c1) / formula_div when ann_band(a_basis[j, s, b]) == f1
  rule f2 v dz2021_2105 = (a_basis[j, s, b] * ann_r2 + ann_c2) / formula_div when ann_band(a_basis[j, s, b]) == f2
  rule outside v dz2021_2105 = 0 when ann_band(a_basis[j, s, b]) in [below, above]
  rule repealed beats f1, f2, outside v dz2022_1265_y = 0

def joint_base[y in yr, j in jcase]: num PLN at start_of(y)
  note "art. 26 ust. 4c: spouses filing jointly each deduct the relief figured on half their combined A; this is their combined income after it"
  rule base v dz2021_2105 = sum(emp_income[j, s] - ann_relief[y, j, s, joint] for s in spouse)

def mon_applies[c in mcase, m in mo]: bool at start_of(m)
  note "art. 32 ust. 2a: the payer reduces the income for months in which the employment revenue is from the lower limit to the upper one"
  rule base v dz2021_2105 = mon_band(month_a[c]) in [f1, f2]
  rule repealed beats base v dz2022_1265_m = false

def mon_relief[c in mcase, m in mo]: num PLN at start_of(m)
  note "the payroll relief as the reading rounds it"
  rule gr_down = round(mon_relief_x[c, m], minor(PLN), down) when mc_round == gr_down
  rule gr_exact = mon_relief_x[c, m] when mc_round == gr_exact
  rule gr_half_up = round(mon_relief_x[c, m], minor(PLN), half-up) when mc_round == gr_half_up

def mon_relief_x[c in mcase, m in mo]: num PLN at start_of(m)
  note "art. 32 ust. 2a: the payer reduces the month's income by the relief, by formula 1 or 2"
  rule f1 v dz2021_2105 = (month_a[c] * mon_r1 - mon_c1) / formula_div when mon_band(month_a[c]) == f1
  rule f2 v dz2021_2105 = (month_a[c] * mon_r2 + mon_c2) / formula_div when mon_band(month_a[c]) == f2
  rule outside v dz2021_2105 = 0 when mon_band(month_a[c]) in [below, above]
  rule repealed beats f1, f2, outside, waived v dz2022_1265_m = 0
  rule waived beats f1, f2 v dz2021_2105 = 0 when waiver[c]

def month_a[c in mcase]: money PLN at reader
  note "art. 32 ust. 2a: A is the month's employment revenue taxed under art. 27, every partial payment of the month added (MF taxpayer guide p. 8); cash benefits from social insurance are not employment revenue (MF employer guide p. 2)"
  rule base v dz2021_2105 = sum(pay_amount[p] for p in payment where pay_case[p] == c and pay_kind[p] == employment)

def tax_2021_ind[j in jcase, s in spouse]: money PLN at reader
  note "the MF tables' '2021 rules' figures for one taxpayer"
  rule base = ?"The 2021 law behind the MF tables' '2021 rules' figures is not among the case's sources."

def tax_2021_joint[j in jcase]: money PLN at reader
  note "the MF spouses table's '2021 rules' figure for the joint return"
  rule base = ?"The 2021 law behind the MF tables' '2021 rules' figures is not among the case's sources."

def tax_base[y in yr, j in jcase, s in spouse]: money PLN at start_of(y)
  note "the base of the tax, a podstawa opodatkowania, rounded to full złoty: Ordynacja podatkowa art. 63 § 1"
  rule base v dz2011_1707 = round(tax_income[y, j, s], 1, half-up)

def tax_income[y in yr, j in jcase, s in spouse]: num PLN at start_of(y)
  note "art. 26 ust. 1 pkt 2aa: the year's employment income less the relief figured on the spouse's own A. Only employment income is modelled, as in the MF simulations"
  rule base v dz2021_2105 = emp_income[j, s] - ann_relief[y, j, s, individual]

def tax_ind[y in yr, j in jcase, s in spouse]: money PLN at start_of(y)
  note "the year's tax, a kwota podatku, rounded to full złoty: Ordynacja podatkowa art. 63 § 1"
  rule base v dz2011_1707 = round(tax_raw[y, j, s], 1, half-up)

def tax_joint[y in yr, j in jcase]: money PLN at start_of(y)
  note "the tax of spouses filing jointly under art. 6 ust. 2, on joint_base"
  rule base = ?"The joint taxation method of art. 6 ust. 2 is not transcribed in the case."

def tax_raw[y in yr, j in jcase, s in spouse]: num PLN at start_of(y)
  note "art. 27 ust. 1: the scale on the rounded base"
  rule base v dz2021_2105 = pit_scale(tax_base[y, j, s])

ask ask_annual_now: ann_applies[2022, j, s, b] for j in jcase, s in spouse, b in basis law 2026-10-18

ask ask_july: mon_relief[c, 2022-07], mon_applies[c, 2022-07] for c in [m1, m2] law 2026-10-18

