version mf_employer_2022
  cite mf_employer
  governs always
  known 2022-04-07
  note "no items: the version the add-back rule cites. p. 4, Przykład II states the method; wersja z 06.04.2022"
  note "guidance, known from its first public release (§4.5). No release notice was found. The PDF at its public URL carries HTTP Last-Modified 7 April 2022, 07:28 GMT (Wayback capture of 5 August 2022, the earliest), taken as its release; the PDF was created on 6 April 2022, 11:58 CEST. Round 2 took 6 April 2022, the guide's version date"

version dz2022_1265_m
  cite du2022_1265
  governs 2022-07-01..
  known 2022-06-15
  note "ogłoszona 2022-06-15; art. 40: in force 1 July 2022"
  note "art. 18 ust. 3: Przepisów art. 32 ust. 2a i 2b ... nie stosuje się do dochodów (przychodów) uzyskanych od dnia 1 lipca 2022 r.; art. 23 ust. 4: from 1 July to 31 December 2022 the income is not reduced by the relief of art. 32 ust. 2a"
  note "art. 23 ust. 1 sets the advance rate for July to December 2022; the new art. 27 ust. 1 (art. 1 pkt 13) gives the first bracket's kwota zmniejszająca podatek that art. 32 ust. 3 reads from 1 July 2022"
  replace adv_rate = 0.12 governs 2022-07-01..2022-12-31 "art. 23 ust. 1: od dochodów uzyskanych w okresie od dnia 1 lipca 2022 r. do dnia 31 grudnia 2022 r. zamiast stawki 17% stosuje się stawkę 12%"
  replace free_amount = 3600 "art. 1 pkt 13, art. 27 ust. 1: 12% minus kwota zmniejszająca podatek 3600 zł"

version dz2022_1265_y
  cite du2022_1265
  governs 2022-01-01..
  known 2022-06-15
  enters 2022-07-01
  note "art. 40: in force 1 July 2022; art. 1 pkt 10, art. 1 pkt 13 lit. a and art. 18 ust. 1-2 are not among its exceptions. Its default enters would be 15 June 2022, the later of known and the start of governs (§5.3). A wording pin to 30 June 2022, as the art. 26 hypothetical tax reads the scale and the relief ('w brzmieniu z dnia 30 czerwca 2022 r.'), needs it; no published figure asks for that tax, so no ask uses the pin"
  note "art. 18 ust. 2: Przepisów art. 26 ust. 1 pkt 2aa i ust. 4a-4c ... w brzmieniu dotychczasowym, nie stosuje się do dochodów (przychodów) uzyskanych od dnia 1 stycznia 2022 r.; art. 1 pkt 10 repeals them; the relief survives only in the art. 26 hypothetical tax, in force from 1 January 2023"
  note "art. 18 ust. 1: the new art. 27 ust. 1 scale applies to income from 1 January 2022"
  replace pit_scale: (-inf, 120000] = 0.12 * x - 3600 "art. 1 pkt 13, art. 27 ust. 1: do 120 000 zł, 12% minus kwota zmniejszająca podatek 3600 zł"
  replace pit_scale: (120000, inf) = 10800 + 0.32 * (x - band_lo(pit_scale, x)) "art. 1 pkt 13, art. 27 ust. 1: ponad 120 000 zł, 10 800 zł + 32% nadwyżki ponad 120 000 zł"
