source lifted_1_0_1 "Figures tally 1.0.1 allowed inline in rules"

source modeller "The model's own readings and assumptions, each stated with its reason"

source stb_2020_546 "Wet van 16 december 2020 (Wet aanpassing box 3), Stb. 2020, 546, uitgegeven 23-12-2020: art. I onderdeel A, art. 2.13 '30%' vervangen door '31%'" at "https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl/stb-2020-546.html"

