,9:I:M:CH-04,12:checks-green,34:run integration/models/CH-04.tally,9791:30:integration/models/CH-04.tally,9751:model ch04
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "US real GDP for 2019:Q4 as known at each monthly vintage of the Philadelphia Fed Real-Time Data Set (ROUTPUT), its quarter-over-quarter annualized growth on first, second, third and most recent release, and the three BEA news releases that checked it."
  note "Each vintage is a version known on the last day of its month: the documentation dates a vintage only by its month, collected in the middle of the month (ROUTPUT notes item 7; General Notes p. 12), and a source dated only by a month takes the month's last day (LANGUAGE §4.5). Each vintage ask is cut on that same day. ROUTPUT26M10's month ends after the model's on; the workbook that holds it is stamped 09-30-2026, so it is known that day."
  note "A revised estimate of a past quarter is a correction (LANGUAGE §4.5): BEA's second and third estimates, and the vintages that revise 2019:Q3 or 2019:Q4."
  note "The growth formula is the Philadelphia Fed's Step 1 (First/Second/Third documentation, PDF p. 3). It is model wiring with no v: that document was last updated 2026-05-21, so a rule cited to it would not exist as known in 2020."

source bea_20_04 "BEA News Release BEA 20-04, Gross Domestic Product, Fourth Quarter and Year 2019 (Advance Estimate), January 30, 2020" at "https://www.bea.gov/sites/default/files/2020-01/gdp4q19_adv_0.pdf"

source bea_20_07 "BEA News Release BEA 20-07, Gross Domestic Product, Fourth Quarter and Year 2019 (Second Estimate), February 27, 2020" at "https://www.bea.gov/sites/default/files/2020-02/gdp4q19_2nd_0.pdf"

source bea_20_13 "BEA News Release BEA 20-13, Gross Domestic Product (Third Estimate), Fourth Quarter and Year 2019, March 26, 2020" at "https://www.bea.gov/sites/default/files/2020-03/gdp4q19_3rd_0.pdf"

source lifted_1_0_1 "Figures tally 1.0.1 allowed inline in rules"

source philly_routput "Philadelphia Fed Real-Time Data Set for Macroeconomists, ROUTPUT monthly vintages, routputMvQd.xlsx (internal timestamps 09-30-2026; downloaded 2026-10-18)" at "https://www.philadelphiafed.org/surveys-and-data/real-time-data-research/routput"

unit bn "billions of real dollars, seasonally adjusted at annual rates"

axis disp
  half-up "printed figures are rounded to the nearest, a tie away from zero"
  down "printed figures are truncated"

index obs = [y2019q3, y2019q4, y2020q1]

input bea_growth19q4_4: int
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input bea_level[q in obs]: num bn question "What level of real GDP did this BEA release print for the quarter?"

input growth19q4_4: int
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input routput[q in obs]: num bn question "What was real GDP for this quarter in the vintage as known on this day?"

def bea_change19q4: num bn = bea_level[y2019q4] - bea_level[y2019q3] at reader

def bea_growth19q4: num = (pow(bea_level[y2019q4] / bea_level[y2019q3], bea_growth19q4_4) - 1) / 1 % at reader

def growth19q4: num = (pow(routput[y2019q4] / routput[y2019q3], growth19q4_4) - 1) / 1 % at reader

ask bea_adv: bea_level[y2019q3], bea_level[y2019q4], bea_change19q4, round(bea_growth19q4, 0.1, disp) law 2020-01-30 as known 2020-01-30

ask bea_second: bea_level[y2019q3], bea_level[y2019q4], bea_change19q4, round(bea_growth19q4, 0.1, disp) law 2020-02-27 as known 2020-02-27

ask bea_third: bea_level[y2019q3], bea_level[y2019q4], bea_change19q4, round(bea_growth19q4, 0.1, disp) law 2020-03-26 as known 2020-03-26

ask chk_adv_20m2: check bea_level[y2019q4] as if {known 2020-01-30} == routput[y2019q4] as if {known 2020-02-29} law 2026-10-18

ask chk_second_20m3: check bea_level[y2019q4] as if {known 2020-02-27} == routput[y2019q4] as if {known 2020-03-31} law 2026-10-18

ask chk_third_20m4: check bea_level[y2019q4] as if {known 2020-03-26} == routput[y2019q4] as if {known 2020-04-30} law 2026-10-18

ask growth_first: round(growth19q4, 0.0001, disp) law 2020-02-29 as known 2020-02-29

ask growth_recent: round(growth19q4, 0.0001, disp) law 2026-09-30 as known 2026-09-30

ask growth_second: round(growth19q4, 0.0001, disp) law 2020-03-31 as known 2020-03-31

ask growth_third: round(growth19q4, 0.0001, disp) law 2020-04-30 as known 2020-04-30

ask v20m1: routput[q] for q in obs law 2020-01-31 as known 2020-01-31

ask v20m2: routput[q] for q in obs law 2020-02-29 as known 2020-02-29

ask v20m3: routput[q] for q in obs law 2020-03-31 as known 2020-03-31

ask v20m4: routput[q] for q in obs law 2020-04-30 as known 2020-04-30

ask v20m5: routput[q] for q in obs law 2020-05-31 as known 2020-05-31

ask v20m8: routput[q] for q in obs law 2020-08-31 as known 2020-08-31

ask v23m10: routput[q] for q in obs law 2023-10-31 as known 2023-10-31

ask v26m10: routput[q] for q in obs law 2026-09-30 as known 2026-09-30

